# --- personal data ---
# Your master resume and any tailored output (docx/pdf) contain personal information.
# This project folder doubles as your personal workspace, so anything exported here
# (e.g. David_Aromose_Master_Resume*.pdf) must never be picked up by a public commit.
*.docx
*.pdf
!template-master-resume.docx
master-resume.docx
jobs/
output/

